"ordinal":366267,"en":"And splendid Sarybai"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l010","ordinal":366268,"en":"Towered like a green poplar."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l011","ordinal":366269,"en":"That infidel Sarybai—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l012","ordinal":366270,"en":"Throughout the whole wide world,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l013","ordinal":366271,"en":"That shield-wielding warrior—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l014","ordinal":366272,"en":"See his brows like a crouching hound,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l015","ordinal":366273,"en":"See his head as large as a cauldron,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l016","ordinal":366274,"en":"His beard like a quiver case,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l017","ordinal":366275,"en":"The breath issuing from his mouth"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l018","ordinal":366276,"en":"Like flame from a bellows."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l019","ordinal":366277,"en":"Ask no more of that wretch;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l020","ordinal":366278,"en":"Behold what he looked like:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l021","ordinal":366279,"en":"His nose like a jagged ice ridge,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l022","ordinal":366280,"en":"As though he would devour the world."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l023","ordinal":366281,"en":"A fierce and venomous man,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l024","ordinal":366282,"en":"Whose menace made men panic,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l025","ordinal":366283,"en":"As though he would slaughter the whole world"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l026","ordinal":366284,"en":"And stride on, licking it clean."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l027","ordinal":366285,"en":"Such was the bloodthirsty tyrant."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l028","ordinal":366286,"en":"He thundered before his army;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l029","ordinal":366287,"en":"Unable to endure his wrath,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l030","ordinal":366288,"en":"The great host fled in thunder."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l031","ordinal":366289,"en":"He grew ever more menacing,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l032","ordinal":366290,"en":"Raged and made ready;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l033","ordinal":366291,"en":"A single hair of his mustache"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l034","ordinal":366292,"en":"Was like the haft of a weighted whip."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l035","ordinal":366293,"en":"Furious and maddened,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l036","ordinal":366294,"en":"Assuming a hundred fearsome forms—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l037","ordinal":366295,"en":"Such was his appearance."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l038","ordinal":366296,"en":"Allowing no warrior ahead of him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l039","ordinal":366297,"en":"He loomed like a grain sack."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l040","ordinal":366298,"en":"Sarybai, wrapped in mail,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l001","ordinal":366299,"en":"Such was his splendor."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l002","ordinal":366300,"en":"His army strained forward,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l003","ordinal":366301,"en":"And behind Sarybai"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l004","ordinal":366302,"en":"His champions made ready."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l005","ordinal":366303,"en":"They climbed the ridges and crossed the passes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l006","ordinal":366304,"en":"Surging over them toward this side."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l007","ordinal":366305,"en":"The mountains seemed dug out and hollowed;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l008","ordinal":366306,"en":"They drew and stretched their bows."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l009","ordinal":366307,"en":"At each one's grim appearance,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l010","ordinal":366308,"en":"The whole body of anyone they seized"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l011","ordinal":366309,"en":"Shuddered from head to foot."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l012","ordinal":366310,"en":"With musket, bow, and spear,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l013","ordinal":366311,"en":"The enraged warrior's"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l014","ordinal":366312,"en":"Renown surpassed all others."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l015","ordinal":366313,"en":"Among the people on earth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l016","ordinal":366314,"en":"Across the world struck by his turmoil,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l017","ordinal":366315,"en":"He yielded his weapon to no living soul."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l018","ordinal":366316,"en":"Swaying and streaming,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l019","ordinal":366317,"en":"The earth bent beneath the upheaval;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l020","ordinal":366318,"en":"Many hosts had he fought,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l021","ordinal":366319,"en":"Many foes had he grappled."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l022","ordinal":366320,"en":"His eyes reddened like a lion's;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l023","ordinal":366321,"en":"Whoever came before him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l024","ordinal":366322,"en":"He crushed to dust,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l025","ordinal":366323,"en":"Drenched and steeped in blood;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l026","ordinal":366324,"en":"When he struck, he spared no life."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l027","ordinal":366325,"en":"Such was Sarybai's way."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l028","ordinal":366326,"en":"Fearsome and unconcerned,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l029","ordinal":366327,"en":"He counted the entire world"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l030","ordinal":366328,"en":"As less than the hem of his robe."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l031","ordinal":366329,"en":"“I alone shall conquer it,” he said,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l032","ordinal":366330,"en":"Crushing all who opposed him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l033","ordinal":366331,"en":"“Have I not driven men before me and devoured them?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l034","ordinal":366332,"en":"Over the whole vast world"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l035","ordinal":366333,"en":"I alone shall be sovereign,” he said."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l036","ordinal":366334,"en":"Sarybai raged,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l037","ordinal":366335,"en":"And the vast, frantic people"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l038","ordinal":366336,"en":"Found their days constricted;"}]
